{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outwall</strong> is a fantasy survival adventure where you play as a villager captured by an evil sorcerer and forced into a deadly game. Your only goal: escape. <br> <br>\ud83e\udd1d<strong>Co-op mode for up to 4 players</strong> \u2014 Work as a team to survive and complete missions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc94Survive the Night</strong> \u2013 Each night, hordes of monsters emerge. Gather resources, fortify your defenses, and fight to see the next sunrise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd12Explore Dangerous Dungeons</strong> \u2013 Venture beyond the walls to discover hidden dungeons filled with powerful loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a<strong>Hunt Mighty Bosses</strong> \u2013 Track down colossal bosses, claim rare materials, and forge legendary weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a fight for survival. Every night is a test of your courage. Can you outlast the walls?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946470?t=1756785746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946470/c9667ae0062da7637acb5e9a95d82b2cc8d5823f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756785746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946470/289d7ef002496950c7c5f8a6a71cc367516bbf81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756785746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946470/289d7ef002496950c7c5f8a6a71cc367516bbf81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756785746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outwall</strong> is a fantasy survival adventure where you play as a vill